      "pot": {
        "content": "```python\ndef solution():\n    # Define variables name and value\n    market_index_values = [3, 2, 4, 5, 6]\n    nav_changes = [5, 4, 6, 7, 9]\n    n = len(market_index_values)\n\n    # Do math calculation to get the answer\n    sum_x = sum(market_index_values)\n    sum_y = sum(nav_changes)\n    sum_xy = sum(x * y for x, y in zip(market_index_values, nav_changes))\n    sum_x_squared = sum(x ** 2 for x in market_index_values)\n\n    slope = (n * sum_xy - sum_x * sum_y) / (\n        n * sum_x_squared - sum_x ** 2\n    )\n    answer = round(slope, 2)\n\n    # return answer\n    return answer\n```",
